! NXonaut menu: Start NXonaut under its own NXonaut menu (menuscript).
VERSION 120
EDIT UG_GATEWAY_MAIN_MENUBAR

BEFORE UG_HELP
  CASCADE_BUTTON NXONAUT_MENU
  LABEL NXonaut
END_OF_BEFORE

MENU NXONAUT_MENU
  BUTTON NXONAUT_START
  LABEL Start NXonaut
  MESSAGE Start the NXonaut bridge for Claude, or show its panel when it already runs
  BITMAP nxonaut
  ACTIONS nxonaut_start.py
END_OF_MENU
